      <text>30.2 Cumulative Frequency Table</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>For this question, your browser may ask whether you want to "leave the page". In this case, you should click leave and your answer will be saved.</p>

<p><br>(a) A student collects data on the height of flowers in a garden, they put the data into a table.
<br>Fill in the cumulative frequency column of the table:</p>
<p><br></p>

<center>
<table style="width:500px; border:1px solid black; text-align:left">
  <tr style="height:70px; border-bottom:1px solid black">
    <th style="padding:10px">Range \([cm]\)</th>
    <th style="padding:10px">Frequency</th>
    <th style="padding:10px">Cumulative Frequency</th>
  </tr>
  <tr style="height:70px; border-bottom:1px solid black"">
    <td style="padding:10px">\(0 < x \leq {@first(p1)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px">\(0\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px">\(0\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr style="height:70px; border-bottom:1px solid black"">
    <td style="padding:10px">\({@first(p1)@} < x \leq {@first(p2)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px">\({@second(p2)-second(p1)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px; vertical-align:bottom">[[input:ans1]]</td>
  </tr>
  <tr style="height:70px; border-bottom:1px solid black"">
    <td style="padding:10px">\({@first(p2)@} < x \leq {@first(p3)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px">\({@second(p3)-second(p2)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px; vertical-align:bottom">[[input:ans2]]</td>
  </tr>
  <tr style="height:70px; border-bottom:1px solid black"">
    <td style="padding:10px">\({@first(p3)@} < x \leq {@first(p4)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px">\({@second(p4)-second(p3)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px; vertical-align:bottom">[[input:ans3]]</td>
  </tr>
  <tr style="height:70px; border-bottom:1px solid black"">
    <td style="padding:10px">\({@first(p4)@} < x \leq {@first(p5)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px">\({@second(p5)-second(p4)@}\)</td>
    <td style="padding:10px; vertical-align:bottom">[[input:ans4]]</td>
